{"nodes": [{"id": "improvements_md", "label": "IMPROVEMENTS.md \u2014 Melhorias Profissionais Firmware v2.0 (#11 Serra Rocketry)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p0_1_degraded_sensor_modes", "label": "P0-1: Degrada\u00e7\u00e3o expl\u00edcita por sensor (NOMINAL / BARO_ONLY / IMU_ONLY / NO_FLIGHT) \u2014 falha de IMU no boot hoje significa nenhum paraquedas; fail-operational vs fail-safe", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L28-L47", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p0_2_state_estimator_apogee_consensus", "label": "P0-2: Estimador \u03b1-\u03b2 (g-h) ou Kalman 1-D com estado (h, vz) + apogeu por consenso temporal e f\u00edsico em vez de amostra \u00fanica", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L51-L73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p0_3_ejection_feedback_dual_channel", "label": "P0-3: Eje\u00e7\u00e3o com realimenta\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 separar deploy_commanded / deploy_actuated / deploy_confirmed no SensorData, segundo canal independente, BIT no pad", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L77-L95", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p0_4_unified_ejection_service", "label": "P0-4: Bug real \u2014 deploy por backstop/conting\u00eancia n\u00e3o persiste em NVS; servi\u00e7o \u00fanico requestParachuteDeploy(DeploySource) + CRC32 e dual-slot no NvsSnapshot", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L99-L116", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p0_5_lora_single_owner", "label": "P0-5: R\u00e1dio LoRa compartilhado por TelemetryTask e LoggerTask sem mutex no mesmo SPI do SD \u2014 mutex por barramento ou \u00fanica task de r\u00e1dio com fila", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L120-L136", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p0_6_binary_short_frame", "label": "P0-6: Telemetria CSV a 5 Hz n\u00e3o cabe no enlace LoRa SF7/BW125 (ToA > per\u00edodo) \u2014 frame bin\u00e1rio curto 20-30 B a 5 Hz + CSV completo a 0,5-1 Hz", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L140-L161", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p1_1_watchdog_all_tasks", "label": "P1-1: Watchdog cobre s\u00f3 taskFlightControl \u2014 registrar as tr\u00eas tasks no TWDT, panic handler que preserve o snapshot, contador de reboots com causa", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L167-L169", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p1_2_imu_range_calibration_saturation", "label": "P1-2: IMU sem range expl\u00edcito nem calibra\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 configurar \u00b116 g, calibrar offsets no pad (NVS), flag imu_saturated em vez de descartar amostras; bias documentado de +2,81 m/s\u00b2", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L171-L174", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p1_3_psram_flight_log_buffer", "label": "P1-3: Escrita em flash durante o voo \u2014 acumular frames em PSRAM (8 MB), manter File aberto, gravar bin\u00e1rio com CRC e converter para CSV no p\u00f3s-voo", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L176-L179", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p1_4_health_telemetry_package", "label": "P1-4: Exportar a sa\u00fade do sistema \u2014 pacote de sa\u00fade a 0,2 Hz com cycleCount, overrunCount, queueDropCount, stack high-water mark, causa de reset, modo degradado e git hash", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L181-L183", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p1_5_gps_fix_age_vote", "label": "P1-5: GPS entra na decis\u00e3o de voo \u2014 usar location.age() (fix n\u00e3o expira hoje) e GPS como terceira fonte independente de altitude/velocidade por voto de confirma\u00e7\u00e3o", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L185-L187", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p1_6_two_step_arm_command", "label": "P1-6: Comando ARM s\u00f3 por USB sem confirma\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 evoluir para comando via LoRa com ack, sequ\u00eancia de dois passos (ARM? \u2192 ARM!), DISARM/STATUS e indica\u00e7\u00e3o sonora", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L189-L190", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p1_7_counter_width_wrap", "label": "P1-7: Contadores que estouram em voo longo \u2014 SensorData.packet_count uint16_t estoura em ~3,6 h a 5 Hz; passar para uint32_t e tratar wrap de millis()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L192-L193", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p1_8_pin_doc_drift", "label": "P1-8: Documenta\u00e7\u00e3o de pinos divergente do c\u00f3digo (SERVO_PIN 39 vs 'GPIO7', pinos SPI 12/13/11 vs 4/2/3) \u2014 em hardware de voo, coment\u00e1rio errado de pino \u00e9 defeito de seguran\u00e7a", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L195-L196", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p2_1_native_host_cpp_tests", "label": "P2-1: Testar o C++ real no host (PlatformIO native + Unity, stubs de Arduino, replay do CSV de voo real, fault injection) em vez do modelo paralelo FSM_Tester.py", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L202-L205", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p2_2_reproducible_ci_static_analysis", "label": "P2-2: Build reproduz\u00edvel + an\u00e1lise est\u00e1tica em CI \u2014 migrar da Arduino IDE para PlatformIO; -Wall -Wextra -Werror, cppcheck, clang-tidy, clang-format", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L207-L208", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p2_3_ms_constants_static_assert", "label": "P2-3: Tempo em ms com static_assert em vez de 'ciclos a X Hz' \u2014 definir *_MS e derivar ciclos por constexpr para que mudar 5 Hz \u2192 25 Hz n\u00e3o recalibre o sistema em sil\u00eancio", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L210-L212", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p2_4_no_dynamic_allocation_critical_path", "label": "P2-4: Eliminar aloca\u00e7\u00e3o din\u00e2mica e String do caminho cr\u00edtico \u2014 inst\u00e2ncias est\u00e1ticas, buffers fixos com snprintf, heap s\u00f3 na inicializa\u00e7\u00e3o (regra 3 do Power of Ten)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "IMPROVEMENTS.md", "source_location": "L214-L216", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "improvements_p2_5_flight_config_traceability", "label": "P2-5: Rastreabilidade de configura\u00e7\u00e3o de voo \u2014 gravar thresholds efetivos, git hash e modo degradado no cabe\u00e7alho do CSV e no pacote de sa\u00fade", "file_type": "rationa